msgstr "获得Mon3tr后解锁。"

#. STRINGS.UI.KALTSIT_MON3TR_SKILL.LOCKED_DESC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.KALTSIT_MON3TR_SKILL.LOCKED_DESC.2"
msgid "Unlocks when the master's maximum Intellect reaches 50."
msgstr "主人智识上限达到50时解锁。"

#. STRINGS.UI.KALTSIT_MON3TR_SKILL.LOCKED_DESC.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.KALTSIT_MON3TR_SKILL.LOCKED_DESC.3"
msgid "Unlocks when the master's maximum Intellect reaches 100."
msgstr "主人智识上限达到100时解锁。"

#. STRINGS.UI.KALTSIT_MON3TR_SKILL.LOCKED_DESC.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.KALTSIT_MON3TR_SKILL.LOCKED_DESC.4"
msgid "Unlocks when the master's maximum Intellect reaches 150."
msgstr "主人智识上限达到150时解锁。"

#. STRINGS.UI.KALTSIT_MON3TR_SKILL.LOCKED_DESC.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.KALTSIT_MON3TR_SKILL.LOCKED_DESC.5"
msgid "Unlocks when the master's maximum Intellect reaches 200."
msgstr "主人智识上限达到200时解锁。"

#. STRINGS.UI.KALTSIT_MON3TR_SKILL.LEVEL_DESC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.KALTSIT_MON3TR_SKILL.LEVEL_DESC.1"
msgid "The master and Mon3tr intimidate nearby panicable creatures within 10 units for 10 seconds. Charges for 30 seconds."
msgstr "主人与Mon3tr同时恐吓各自10距离单位内可恐慌的生物，恐慌持续10秒。充能30秒。"

#. STRINGS.UI.KALTSIT_MON3TR_SKILL.LEVEL_DESC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.KALTSIT_MON3TR_SKILL.LEVEL_DESC.2"
msgid "Mon3tr automatically leaps to an enemy within 8 units. On landing, it deals twice its normal attack damage to enemies within a 4-unit radius and draws the aggro of those hit. Cooldown: 10 seconds."
msgstr "Mon3tr自动跃向8距离单位内的敌人，落地时对半径4距离单位内的敌人造成自身普攻2倍的伤害，并吸引被命中敌人的仇恨。冷却时间10秒。"

#. STRINGS.UI.KALTSIT_MON3TR_SKILL.LEVEL_DESC.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.KALTSIT_MON3TR_SKILL.LEVEL_DESC.3"
msgid "Caps each hit taken by the master and Mon3tr at 15% of their maximum health. Overhealing becomes temporary shields; the master's healing increases by 100%. Lasts 30 seconds, then charges for 60 seconds."
msgstr "主人与Mon3tr单次受到的伤害不超过各自最大生命值的15%。溢出治疗转为临时护盾，主人治疗量提高100%。持续30秒；结束后充能60秒。"

#. STRINGS.UI.KALTSIT_MON3TR_SKILL.LEVEL_DESC.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.KALTSIT_MON3TR_SKILL.LEVEL_DESC.4"
msgid "The master and Mon3tr immediately swap positions and each gain one Bone Armor effect. Charges for 60 seconds."
msgstr "主人与Mon3tr立即互换位置，双方各获得一次骨甲效果。充能60秒。"

#. STRINGS.UI.KALTSIT_MON3TR_SKILL.LEVEL_DESC.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.KALTSIT_MON3TR_SKILL.LEVEL_DESC.5"
msgid "Mon3tr enters attack mode and deals true damage for 20 seconds. Each second, its stackable damage reduction falls from +50% to 0%, and attack bonus from +200% to 0%. With no kills, it loses 50% of maximum health on expiry. Then charges for 200 seconds."
msgstr "Mon3tr进入攻击模式并造成真实伤害，持续20秒。额外减伤从50%逐渐降至0%，可与其它减伤叠加；攻击加成从200%逐渐降至0%，每秒更新。期间未击杀敌人则结束时流失最大生命值的50%。结束后充能200秒。"

#. STRINGS.UI.KALTSIT_MON3TR_SKILL.NOT_IMPLEMENTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.KALTSIT_MON3TR_SKILL.NOT_IMPLEMENTED"
msgid "This skill is not implemented yet."
msgstr "此技能暂未实现。"
